      "description": "The Brass Penitent is a masked Verdan mechanist whose public voice promises safety while every private calculation is stained by the people their machines failed to protect. At the Lunevaris Transit Yard, they design containment automata, rescue constructs, and defensive protocols for the Regent Lattice, but their logic keeps circling one terrible conclusion: protection can become murder when compassion is reduced to efficiency. They are brilliant, theatrical, ashamed, and dangerous whenever guilt is allowed to write engineering doctrine.",
